Z||000030||Brucepts||07-28-2001||10:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>The last thing I added to the shop was the sand blast cabnet, let me say...It should have been the first!!! It's a must.<P>bench Grinder/buffer, mig welder, drill press, parts washer. Just a few of the little thing that make life a little easy<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'll add to this list: Metal lathe, milling machine, valve/seat grinder. <P><P>------------------<BR>Advanced Dealer in the Great Material Continuum . . .<BR>Non Fiero Website: <A HREF="http://tractorsport.com" TARGET=_blank>http://tractorsport.com</A> <BR>You can't race a dyno . . .||||reg||1
